        "fact": "The root command is commander with .argument(\"[prompt]\") and .helpOption(\"-h, --help\"); every root option, listed and hidden (hideHelp), with its arity, is in one builder. Hidden ones rowed by the table: -d2e/--debug-to-stderr, --system-prompt-file, --append-system-prompt-file, --max-turns, --permission-prompt-tool, --remote, --pool, --rc, and now --client-data-url (listed in 2.1.283). Hidden and new since 2.1.283, unrowed (refused as unknown by policy): --fast-mode <on|off> (no parse-time choice check), --allow-other-models, --include-unsupported-models, --host-auth-is-org-sign-in, --proactivity <level> (choices ask, default, proactive, checked at parse), --runner-declares <names>. Listed and new: --desktop.",
